  <XenotypeDef>
    <defName>XylSuccuboid</defName>
    <label>succuboid</label>
    <description>Originally engineered as fashionable companions for glitterworld elites, at some point the succuboids took control of their own reproduction, engineering themselves with the ability to have succuboid daughters regardless of the xenotype of their partner. Now they are viewed variously as prestigious status symbols, valuable commodities, or dangerous social parasites.</description>
